{"type":"message","id":"5ef2a93c","parentId":"0f4fdd7c","timestamp":"2026-02-18T12:56:49.368Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of what was accomplished and report it back. I should also verify that all the key requirements from the task have been met:\n\n1. ✅ Agent ID: coder2\n2. ✅ Model: arcee-ai/trinity-large-preview:free\n3. ✅ Workspace: D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-coder2\n4. ✅ Subagents allowAgents: [\"pluto\"]\n5. ✅ Identity: distinct emoji (🤖)\n6. ✅ Configuration mirrored from coder\n7. ✅ Added to agents.list\n8. ✅ Pluto's allowAgents includes coder2\n\nThe agent is now ready for activation. Let me provide the final report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ Coder 2 Agent Creation Complete\n\nI have successfully created the **Coder 2** agent with the exact specifications requested. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n### 🎯 Agent Configuration\n- **Agent ID**: `coder2`\n- **Name**: \"Coder 2\"\n- **Emoji**: 🤖 (distinct from Coder's 👨‍💻)\n- **Model**: `arcee-ai/trinity-large-preview:free`\n- **Workspace**: `D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-coder2`\n- **Subagents Permissions**: `[\"pluto\"]` (Pluto can send messages to coder2)\n\n### 📁 Files Created in Coder 2 Workspace\n```\nD:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-coder2\\\n├── SOUL.md              # Agent identity & capabilities\n├── USER.md              # User interaction guidelines\n├── TOOLS.md             # Local tool preferences\n├── agent.config.json    # Complete technical configuration\n├── MEMORY.md            # Long-term memory\n└── memory\\\n    └── 2026-02-18.md   # Creation day log\n```\n\n### 🔄 System Integration\n- **Updated `agents.list`**: Added coder2 entry alongside existing coder and pluto agents\n- **Pluto Configuration**: Updated `allowAgents: [\"coder\", \"coder2\"]` to enable communication\n- **Distinct Identity**: Different emoji 🤖 and unique configuration while maintaining same capabilities\n\n### ⚙️ Technical Details\n- **Model**: Same as Coder - `arcee-ai/trinity-large-preview:free`\n- **Capabilities**: Full-stack development across Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Rust, Java, C#, plus frameworks (React, Vue, Node.js, Django, etc.), DevOps, databases\n- **Permissions**: Full workspace access, subagent usage, messaging with Pluto\n- **Memory System**: Daily logs + curated long-term memory\n\n### 🚀 Activation Steps Required\n\n**To activate Coder 2**, you need to:\n\n1. **Start the agent**: Run `openclaw agent start coder2` or use the agent management command\n2. **Verify connection**: Check agent status with `openclaw agent status coder2`\n3. **Test communication**: Have Pluto send a test message to coder2\n4. **Monitor logs**: Check `memory/2026-02-18.md` for any startup issues\n\n### 🔍 Verification Checklist\n- [x] Agent workspace directory created\n- [x] All configuration files written (SOUL.md, USER.md, TOOLS.md, agent.config.json)\n- [x] Main agents.list updated with coder2 entry\n- [x] Pluto's subagents.allowAgents includes coder2\n- [x] Distinct identity established (🤖 emoji)\n- [x] Model configuration matches requirements\n- [x] Memory system initialized\n\n**Status**: Coder 2 is **ready for activation**. The configuration mirrors the existing Coder agent while maintaining distinct identity and proper permissions for Pluto coordination."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":21398,"output":986,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22384,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771419399378}}
